<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- 🦌🦌记录器 month widget (2x2) — sized like the card widget: the box is
     match_parent with a 7dp top anchor so it fills whatever drawable area the
     host actually gives the cell (never computed from the reported options).

     Content: stat line, 一二三四五六日 header, then SIX static weighted week
     rows. Every row is layout_height=0dp + layout_weight=1, so the grid
     always fills the remaining height exactly — a 5-week month simply hides
     the last row (setViewVisibility(GONE)) and the five visible rows split
     the same space, so the cells grow instead of leaving a gap. Rows are
     static (not addView) on purpose: statically declared children are
     guaranteed to keep their layout_weight, which is what makes the fill
     work in RemoteViews.

     Each day cell is a small TextView (not an ImageView) so it can carry the
     day number as well as its state colour: 平时=小字日期, 破戒日=🦌 加日期
     (white on the accent fill), 今天=日期（强调色）, 本月之外=空。provider
     逐格 setTextViewText / setTextColor / setTextViewTextSize / setBackgroundResource。 -->
